To model America/Vancouver as permanent DST in order for formatting APIs to show
Pacific Daylight Time instead of Pacific Standard Time (which is wrong), Mountain
Standard Time (technically right, confusing), or GMT-7 (even more technically
right, but is also confusing).
A distant future transitions are needed to workaround a time zone picker bug:
  * zoneinfo file should have a transition which starts after current date.
  * Because transitions to identical offset/dst are merged a transition to
    the standard time is added.

